        "detailed_description": "<strong>Greedy Darts is a roguelike deckbuilder where you create powerful synergies and aim to clear darts games like Count-Up, Zero-One, and Cricket.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212590/extras/3b2f00c6b9fcc7ba2eb7a6aed3957385.avif?t=1761263782\" width=640 height=180 /></span><br><br>Combine powerful cards and relics to create diverse synergies and builds. As you strengthen your deck, you’ll need to earn enough points to overcome malicious game obstacles. Balancing your deck to handle all game modes is essential. Ultimately, you’ll need to use every possible means to conquer all the games.<br><br>Following the demo and Early Access phases, we plan to include multiple difficulty levels and challenge modes.",
